// Settings > Battery > Low battery warning: a short banner on top of games at 15 % and 5 %,
// and a longer last one at 3 %, so there is time to save before the console turns off.
// Settings > Game mode and its Quick Settings tile: Do Not Disturb and no pop-up
// notifications while playing, optionally switched by the app in front.
// Continue playing (Game mode page, its own tile, FN + A, power menu): back into the last
// game, with RetroArch's and PPSSPP's own last game file; the files are read by the
// andr36oid-gamecomfort init service (Android.mk). Host tests: tests/run-tests.sh.
// Runs as the system user, which may draw a system overlay window, change Do Not Disturb
// and watch the task stack.
android_app {
    name: "GameComfort",
    srcs: ["src/**/*.java"],
    resource_dirs: ["res"],
    certificate: "platform",
    platform_apis: true,
    optimize: {
        enabled: false,
    },
}
